-Uses trilinear interpolation during rendering to reduce the 'stair-stepped' aliasing appearance of voxel-based field lines in LIC textures [S4, unofficial]. This technique smooths field lines and creates a halo effect for better separation of lines, which is particularly important for sparse textures like those in Seed LIC [S4, unofficial].
